// EXPECT: [E015]
// @ctz and @clz of 0 are undefined (the C is __builtin_ctz, and bsf leaves its destination
// unchanged), so their argument owes what a divisor owes: proof that it is not zero. Nothing
// asked for it, and `tz(0)` returned whatever the register held (soundness harness).
func tz(x u32) u32 { return @ctz(x) }
func main() i32 { return tz(0) as i32 }
